{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:331da7e315359140","name":"Jedi Shadow","source":{"id":"source:reference-331da7e315359140","title":"Jedi Shadow","revision":22330,"timestamp":"2024-09-02T17:14:28Z","sha256":"d3b5c27da5b3fae197a078cf1b583e46b4fc2f344e650db12ce3c65d2909f1ce","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=22330","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Jedi%20Shadow&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-331da7e315359140","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi Covenant"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi_Covenant","referenceId":"reference:0080432046f3646f"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Despite the name, Jedi Shadows are steadfast defenders of the light. Shadows are selected for Jedi Council approval by their masters and are trained to sniff out evil. Their goal is the obliteration of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"},", including ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith","referenceId":"reference:32bde5e69837ac8e"}," and any other malevolent ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Tradition"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Tradition"},". In disguise, under cover of night or ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},", they venture where the stench of darkness is pungent, gathering intelligence to deal villainy a killing blow.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Shadows are typically humorless loners. Their perceptions of reality are black and white, and they see signs of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"}," everywhere, even among their peers. Shadows are, therefore, implemented cautiously, seeing most action after epic Force conflicts. They have no qualms about lying to, or betraying those who are evil, but they exercise restraint, understanding their definition of \"evil\" does not always match the Council's. Some Jedi Shadows, however, believe in a more aggressive approach. From these, ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi Covenant"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi_Covenant","referenceId":"reference:0080432046f3646f"}," has created its own secret police of \"Covenant Shadows.\"\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Jedi Shadow Statistics (CL 10)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi","referenceId":"reference:0b0e48747027a29d"}," 7/",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Knight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Knight","referenceId":"reference:8a1e23d924066b37"}," 3\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},":"]}," 2\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +12; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +11\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Basic, Huttese, Sith, 1 Unassigned\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","c